#: ee25c0800a0d450f8c543d37504ab3bc f9143934e7274d0497d6545297683e56
msgid ""
"These days ArduPilot is financially supported by our `Partners "
"<https://ardupilot.org/ardupilot/docs/common-partners.html>`__ and "
":ref:`individuals <common-donation>` but in the early days when ArduPilot "
"was still growing up it was primarily `3DR <https://3dr.com/>`__ (a.k.a. "
"\"3DRobotics\") that provided support.  This sponsorship paid the salaries "
"of some of the core development team, hosting infrastructure for the project"
" websites, and provided hardware as needed.  Thanks 3DR!"
msgstr ""
"如今，ArduPilot 主要由我们的 `合作伙伴 <https://ardupilot.org/ardupilot/docs/common-"
"partners.html>`__ 和 :ref:`个人贡献者 <common-donation>` 提供财务支持，但在 ArduPilot "
"成长初期，主要是 `3DR <https://3dr.com/>`__ "
"（即「3DRobotics」）给予了大力支持。这份赞助支付了部分核心开发团队成员的薪资、项目网站的托管基础设施费用，并提供了所需硬件。感谢 3DR！"

